Date: Wed, 30 Jul 2025 08:00:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 021/190] misc: xilinx-ai-engine: Added support to update
 handshake region

commit b5a997f8e51ed273e3edbefb486ff53164d7ef68 from
https://github.com/Xilinx/linux-xlnx.git xlnx_rebase_v6.12

Added support to update the non-zero offset in the handshake region and
to pass different handshake region data depending on the column.

Signed-off-by: Keerthanna Mohan <keerthanna.mohan@amd.com>
Message-ID: <20250730150045.693566-1-keerthanna.mohan@amd.com>
State: pending
Signed-off-by: Quanyang Wang <quanyang.wang@windriver.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
